OL,3,GNEWSABride jilted at the altar gives
OL,4,Amarriage another go - on Friday 13th
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bride who was jilted at the altar
OL,7,Fsays "everything has fallen into place"
OL,8,Fas she prepares for her second wedding
OL,9,Fin four years.
OL,11,FKayley Stead became a social media
OL,12,Fsensation in 2022 when she decided to
OL,13,Fgo ahead with the celebrations despite
OL,14,Fher fiance not turning up.
OL,16,FBut after reconnecting with an old
OL,17,Funiversity friend, she was able to find
OL,18,Flove again, and the pair are set to tie
OL,19,Fknot on Friday 13th.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
