OL,3,GNEWSABride jilted at the altar gives
OL,4,Amarriage another go - on Friday 13th
OL,5,
OL,6,FReferring to the mysterious
OL,7,Fsuperstition that the day is considered
OL,8,Funlucky, Kayley, from Swansea, said she
OL,9,F"loves a risk" and is feeling great
OL,10,Fabout their big day.
